
title: Sam
---
<<declare $talkedToSam = false>>

<<if $talkedToSam>>
    Sam: Go get your chapel credits!
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>

<<if getBool("hasChapelPass")>>
    Sam: Sweet! You got your chapel pass!
    Sam: Friendly reminder to not get into any trouble! Since more people have free time, I'll be doing checks at the end of day.
    Sam: Don't have anything you shouldn't have! Anywho, chat with others, and have fun!
<<else>>
    Sam: Friendly reminder from your RA, make sure to get the rest of your chapel credits done today! Wouldn't want to get behind!
    -> \[ACTION\] Sir yes sir!
        <<jump NoChapelCredits>>
<<endif>>
===

title: NoChapelCredits
---
<<useAction>>
<<set $talkedToSam = true>>
I can grind one out during class, but the Prof wouldn't be too happy if he saw me. I need a way to distract him...
<<stop>>
===

title: SamLate
---
<<if getBool("teacherDistracted")>>
    Sam: Another victory for the OG's! 
<<else>>
    <<if getBool("samBus")>>
        <<jump OnlySamNarc>>
    <<else>>
        <<jump SamLucaNarc>>
    <<endif>>
    Prof: Regularly scheduled entrance... 
	
    Sam: I'm not late that often!

    Prof: Yes, yes you are.

    Luke: CHUD!
<<endif>>

<<stop>>
===

title: OnlySamNarc
---
Prof: Sam, get your act together.
Prof: See me during office hours later.
Sam: Daw...
Luca: Yes!
<<setBool "samBus" true>>
===

title: SamLucaNarc
---
Prof: ...and you're late, too. Both of you, see me during office hours later.
Sam: Daw...
Luca: Daw...
<<setBool "lucaSamBus" true>>
===
title: SamEndOfDay
---
Sam: As your RA, I get to chat with you! I hope you had a wonderful day today!

<<if !getBool("hasChapelPass")>>
    Sam: Did you get your chapel credits in today?

    -> Yes! <<if getInt("currentCredits") == 4>>
        Sam: Nice! That's impressive work! Here's a reward: a chapel pass, so Willie knows to not mess with you anymore!
        Sam: Go enjoy your extra time during the chapel hour! Just don't do anything crazy, like throw a party or be involved in a creeking...
        New Permanent Item: Chapel Pass!
        <<setBool "hasChapelPass" true>>
        <<EndOfDayComplete>>
        <<stop>>
    -> No. <<if getInt("currentCredits") != 4>>
        Sam: Darn! Well, get those credits done, Willie is cracking down on chapel slackers as of late...
        <<EndWillieDeath>>
        <<stop>>
<<endif>>

Sam: Well, I'll see you tomorrow! Stay out of trouble!
===

title: SamQuad
---
<<if getBool("samGettingBall")>>
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>

Sam: Hey man! Wanna join us?
-> \[ACTION\] Yea sure!
    <<useAction>>
    <<jump playingSpike>>
-> I'm ok
    <<stop>>
-> Can I have your speaker for tonight? <<if getBool("postersHung")>>
    Sam: Absolutely not! NO ONE TOUCHES THEM!
    <<gameOver "If you want his speaker, you need to take it in secret.">>
    <<stop>>
<<stop>>
===

title: playingSpike
---
How do you want to play? 
-> Hit it hard 
    <<jump samRuns>>
-> Hit it soft  
    <<useAction>>
    Sam: Nice drop shot! 
<<stop>>
===

title: samRuns
---
<<SamGetsBall>>
Sam: Good hit, now where is it???
===

title: SamLostSpeaker
---
Sam: YO, where's my speaker?
Greg: Sorry wasn't looking, we were yapping just now. 
Sam: NOOO, WHERE IS IT? 
===

title: GregHelps
---
Greg: You're welcome. Better be a good party.
===

title: SamLunch
---

<<if getBool("lukeHasSpeaker")>>
    Sam: Man, I'm so bumed I lost my speaker.
    -> \[ACTION\] Greg and Ginger have your speaker over there <<if $gingerRevengeArc>>
        <<jump SamLunchRip>>
    -> Sorry about that, good luck.
<<else>>
    Sam is listening to music, ignoring anything around him.
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>
===

title: SamLunchRip
---

Sam: Really? Awesome! Thanks for letting me know!
<<setBool "samSpeakerBack" true>>
<<useAction>>
===